------------------------------------------------------------------
[wry 0.12.1 linux #0-0] Running: wry (v0.12.1) on linux
[wry 0.12.1 linux #0-0] Session ID: 81e0107b-4d38-4eed-9b10-ee80ca47bb83
[wry 0.12.1 linux #0-0]
